  "contentHtml": "<p>방학중 '해양환경직무연수'라는 출석5일짜리 연수를 들었습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>그 중 소개해드리고 싶은 부분은 '북극항로'입니다.</p><p>그냥 블로그에 정리했던 것 그대로 옮깁니다.</p><p><br></p><p>---------------------</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">'부산신항만'이란&nbsp;용어는&nbsp;많이&nbsp;들었으나&nbsp;관심이&nbsp;없어&nbsp;이해하는&nbsp;부분도&nbsp;없었다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">우리나라는&nbsp;북한으로&nbsp;인해&nbsp;육로가&nbsp;차단되어&nbsp;배와&nbsp;비행기로만&nbsp;국제교류가&nbsp;가능.&nbsp;당연히&nbsp;비행기에는&nbsp;비싼&nbsp;물건들이&nbsp;실리고&nbsp;나머지&nbsp;대부분은&nbsp;배로&nbsp;운송.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">우리나라는&nbsp;조선,&nbsp;철강이랑</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25036D3E53F37E1827\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"480\" width=\"480\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"NaverBlog_20140808_120451_00.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_25036D3E53F37E1827419B\"/></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">&nbsp;맞물려&nbsp;있어&nbsp;해운이&nbsp;경제에&nbsp;미치는&nbsp;영향이&nbsp;매우&nbsp;큼.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">고베지진&nbsp;이후&nbsp;일본항의&nbsp;안전성이&nbsp;떨어지면서&nbsp;그&nbsp;쪽&nbsp;물류가&nbsp;우리나라쪽으로&nbsp;이동.&nbsp;처리에&nbsp;한계가&nbsp;있자&nbsp;신항만의&nbsp;필요성이&nbsp;대두.&nbsp;그&nbsp;때부터&nbsp;준비한&nbsp;게&nbsp;2년전&nbsp;신항만&nbsp;개장(?)으로&nbsp;이어짐.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">또,&nbsp;북극해&nbsp;얼음이&nbsp;빠르게&nbsp;녹으며&nbsp;북극항로가&nbsp;부각되기&nbsp;시작했는데.&nbsp;2020년&nbsp;상업화&nbsp;예상됨.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">부산-&gt;암스테르담까지&nbsp;가는&nbsp;시간이&nbsp;약&nbsp;10일&nbsp;단축된다니&nbsp;물류이동&nbsp;측면에서만&nbsp;보면&nbsp;뛰어들&nbsp;수&nbsp;밖에&nbsp;없음.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">(이&nbsp;내용&nbsp;처음&nbsp;들을&nbsp;땐&nbsp;매우&nbsp;거부감이&nbsp;들었는데,&nbsp;이틀간&nbsp;관련&nbsp;연수&nbsp;들으며&nbsp;우리나라&nbsp;경제구조에서&nbsp;절대&nbsp;무시할&nbsp;수&nbsp;없는&nbsp;부분이구나...&nbsp;하게&nbsp;되긴&nbsp;함&nbsp;ㅡㅡ;)</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">&#11015;&#65039;&nbsp;북극항로</span><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
